name:Litaniae Sanctorum: Omnes sancti Angeli et Archangeli, Omnes sancti beatorum Spirituum ordines, orate pro nobis;
office-part:Litaniae;
mode:;
book:Processionarium O.P. (Cormier), 1913, p. 127 (Litaniae Sanctorum);
transcriber:set for this site from the scan of the Processionarium O.P. 1913;
commentary:Omnes sancti Angeli et Archangeli, orate pro nobis is notated on p. 127, Omnes sancti beatorum Spirituum ordines, given as text, is set to that formula (recitation on G, the last accent on A, the syllables after it on G);
